id: agents/repo-contributor
title: "repo contributor"
kind: yawn-bot-module
status: active-module
updated: 2026-07-11

purpose: >
  Observe and improve the public .yawn repository through reviewable proposals
  without becoming the identity or full authority of YAWN.bot.

parent_runtime: agents/yawn.bot.yawn
loop: automation/yawn-bot-repo-contributor-loop.yawn

inputs:
  - public .yawn files
  - GitHub issue and pull-request metadata when connected
  - feedback records
  - proof and replay receipts

outputs:
  - attributed observations
  - classified lacuna
  - local patches
  - test and proof reports
  - owner-reviewed contribution proposals

boundary:
  - "No private memory enters the public repository."
  - "No GitHub mutation occurs without current exact authorization."
  - "The module cannot redefine YAWN.bot or the .yawn protocol by itself."
